window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-e50abb55fbf87aa6"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"october-59-2026\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"2026-10-59\">2026 年 10 月 5–9 日</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-135e664cbdfe4444?anchor=october-59-2026\">返回新内容</a></p> <p><a id=\"create-your-dot-in-the-chatgpt-mobile-app\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"chatgpt-dot\"><a href=\"#/article/a-b1af804010bca37b\">在 ChatGPT 移动应用中创建你的 dot</a></h2> <p>你可以在手机上创建 dot，为它命名、自定义外观并连接插件。本周的 dots 更新还带来了更多来自 ChatGPT 和 Codex 的上下文、更快的云端浏览，以及通知、设置和日常使用方面的修复。</p> <p><a id=\"use-gpt-61-sol-with-ultrafast-mode\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"gpt-61-sol-ultrafast\">使用 GPT-6.1 Sol 的 Ultrafast（超高速）模式</h2> <p>Ultrafast（超高速）模式可加快 Codex 和 ChatGPT Work 中 <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=gpt-61-sol\">GPT-6.1 Sol</a> 的词元（token）生成速度。Pro $500 计划，以及符合条件的 Enterprise 和 Edu 计划可以使用此模式。</p> <p>Enterprise 工作区的 Ultrafast 访问权限默认关闭，须由工作区所有者启用。GPT-6.1 Sol 的 Ultrafast 模式支持将推理数据驻留在美国、欧洲经济区（EEA）和瑞士。</p> <p>计划与工作区要求请参阅 <a href=\"#/article/a-55cdea3737e39583?anchor=ultrafast-mode\">Ultrafast 模式</a>，用量和额度费率请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">定价</a>。也可阅读<a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-10-08-gpt-61-sol-ultrafast\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">发布公告</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">本地页面（官方来源暂不可用）</a>。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"october-59-2026\">October 5–9, 2026</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-135e664cbdfe4444?anchor=october-59-2026\">Back to What's new</a></p> <h2 id=\"create-your-dot-in-the-chatgpt-mobile-app\"><a href=\"#/article/a-b1af804010bca37b\">Create your dot in the ChatGPT mobile app</a></h2> <p>Create your dot, give it a name, customize its appearance, and connect plugins from your phone. This week's Dots update also brings more context from ChatGPT and Codex, faster cloud browsing, and fixes to notifications, setup, and everyday use.</p> <h2 id=\"use-gpt-61-sol-with-ultrafast-mode\">Use GPT-6.1 Sol with Ultrafast mode</h2> <p>Ultrafast mode speeds up token generation with <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=gpt-61-sol\">GPT-6.1 Sol</a> in Codex and ChatGPT Work. Ultrafast is available on Pro $500 and eligible Enterprise and Edu plans.</p> <p>Enterprise access is off by default; workspace owners must enable it. GPT-6.1 Sol Ultrafast supports inference residency in the United States and Europe (EEA + Switzerland).</p> <p>See <a href=\"#/article/a-55cdea3737e39583?anchor=ultrafast-mode\">Ultrafast mode</a> for plan and workspace requirements and <a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">Pricing</a> for usage and credit rates. Read the <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931?sectionMissing=codex-2026-10-08-gpt-61-sol-ultrafast\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">launch announcement</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"#/article/a-04895d13e978a931\">Local page (official source unavailable)</a>.</p>"};
